{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the Bridge is a tribute to one of the earliest roguelikes, <i>Moria</i>. Your journey begins with creating your character by choosing a class. From there, you'll explore six procedurally generated levels before reaching the goal of your quest and making your escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363700/extras/4db33686e067c95424fcbb68ce03a981.avif?t=1739829419\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is <i>Beyond the Bridge</i>?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic roguelike experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 character classes (four of which are unlockable in-game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An item generation system with three rarity levels and an affix system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden merchants, craftsmen and bonuses within the levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A progression system allowing you to carry over items and spells between runs</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3363700?t=1739829419","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3363700?t=1739829419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363700/d898ad2525fab976dcc287979d2f0fa427684734/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739829419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363700/d898ad2525fab976dcc287979d2f0fa427684734/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739829419","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_